So, the probability is 1440 / 46656. 

Simplify this fraction by dividing numerator and denominator by 48: 1440 ÷ 48 = 30, and 46656 ÷ 48 = 972. Then, 30 / 972 can be simplified further by dividing numerator and denominator by 6: 5 / 162. 

