Now we have:

$$
\sqrt{\dfrac{4\sqrt{6}}{\sqrt{6}}}
$$

Simplify the inner fraction:

$$
\dfrac{4\sqrt{6}}{\sqrt{6}} = 4
$$

So now the expression becomes:

