- Second pile = $ x + 2 $ (2 more than third pile)
- First pile = $ x - 1 $ (3 fewer than second pile)
- Fourth pile = $ 2(x + 2) $ (twice the number in the second pile)

The total number of quarters is:

$$
(x - 1) + (x + 2) + x + 2(x + 2) = 20
$$

Simplify the expression:

