First, let me write down the equations of the two lines. 

The first line is given by the point $\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ -1 \\ -3 \end{pmatrix}$ plus t times the direction vector $\begin{pmatrix} 3 \\ k \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}$. 

The second line is given by the point $\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 4 \\ 6 \end{pmatrix}$ plus u times the direction vector $\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 4 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}$.

