The total number of numbers from 3 to 201 inclusive is 201 - 3 + 1 = 199 numbers. So counting from 3 to 201 is 199 numbers. 

When counting back from 201 to 3, the sequence is 201, 200, ..., 54, 53, 52, ..., 3. The position of 53 in this sequence would be the total count from 3 to 201 minus the position of 53 when counting forward, plus 1. That is, n = 199 - 51 + 1 = 149.

